  ('964a1e4c-cadd-53af-8ab2-fe55db22e253', 'Mix Veg Sabzi', 'mix-veg-sabzi', 'A clean-out-the-crisper mixed vegetable curry.', 'North Indian', 'vegan', 15, 20, 3, 'easy', '["Chop all vegetables into even pieces.", "Heat oil, add cumin, onion and ginger garlic paste; saute until golden.", "Add tomato and spices and cook until soft.", "Add vegetables, salt and half a cup of water; cover and cook for 12-15 minutes.", "Finish with garam masala."]'::jsonb, true);
