  ('20f4caaa-f8d0-54a3-8391-afa0d29ad563', 'Aloo Jeera', 'aloo-jeera', 'Quick potatoes tempered with cumin - great with puri or dal.', 'North Indian', 'vegan', 10, 15, 2, 'easy', '["Boil the potatoes until just tender, peel and cube.", "Heat oil, add a generous amount of cumin and green chilli.", "Add potatoes, turmeric, chilli powder, amchur and salt; toss on high heat for 5 minutes.", "Garnish with coriander."]'::jsonb, true);
