  ('94022d52-82df-5866-bb91-d19becf80846', 'Sambar', 'sambar', 'Tangy toor dal and vegetable stew with sambar powder.', 'South Indian', 'vegan', 15, 35, 4, 'medium', '["Pressure cook toor dal with turmeric and 2 cups water until soft; mash.", "Soak tamarind in warm water and extract the pulp.", "Boil the chopped vegetables, onion and tomato in tamarind water with salt until tender.", "Add sambar powder and the mashed dal; simmer for 10 minutes.", "Temper oil with mustard seeds, asafoetida and curry leaves and pour over."]'::jsonb, true);
