  ('da4008cf-57ec-589a-9149-d9d4aa8a171f', 'Tomato Rasam', 'tomato-rasam', 'Light, peppery tomato and tamarind soup.', 'South Indian', 'vegan', 10, 20, 3, 'easy', '["Soak tamarind in warm water and extract the juice.", "Crush pepper, cumin and garlic coarsely.", "Boil chopped tomatoes in tamarind water with salt, the crushed spices and rasam powder for 10 minutes.", "Add cooked dal if using and 1 cup water; bring to a froth but do not boil hard.", "Temper with mustard seeds, asafoetida and curry leaves; garnish with coriander."]'::jsonb, true);
