  ('2ea70100-80a4-5d28-827d-ea8c52db042f', 'Palak Dal', 'palak-dal', 'Toor dal cooked with spinach - an easy way to rescue wilting greens.', 'North Indian', 'vegan', 10, 25, 3, 'easy', '["Pressure cook dal with turmeric, salt and 2 cups water for 3 whistles.", "Heat oil, add cumin, asafoetida and garlic; add tomato and chilli powder.", "Add chopped spinach and cook until wilted.", "Add the dal and simmer for 5 minutes."]'::jsonb, true);
